msgid ""
"There is not enough disk space to save the file. Please free some disk space "
"and try again."
msgstr ""
"Ruang cakera tidak mencukupi untuk menyimpan fail. Sila bebaskan sedikit "
"ruang cakera dan cuba lagi."

